  "StockRole": "Striker",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Daedalus is a Solaris VII BattleMech, which was developed from an original Phoenix Hawk PXH-1 in the middle of the thirty-first century. Innovative Design Concepts took the original Phoenix Hawk design and updated it with several missile racks and the newly rediscovered large pulse laser, while utilizing speed to keep the design maneuvering out of tight situations.",
